            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604030/extras/5f7a736326ce0d8fc9d6d7cadb85c952.avif?t=1792452403\" width=456 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if the thing you always dreamed of building becomes your worst nightmare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2065, chrome skyscrapers and holographic ads tower over alleyways of blood and grime. Money rules. Corporations own the future. Everyone else scrapes by.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Kazu, a young technophile trying to prove he belongs as a cybernetics designer. All he wanted was an entertainment system that would finally open doors. What he creates instead is the Virtual Machine: a breakthrough that was never supposed to exist… and that the wrong people will kill to control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunted by criminals and corrupt officials alike, Kazu is pulled into virtual worlds designed to weed out the weak — from a mythological age that never was, to a future where humanity is only a memory. His own life is on the line. So is the life of the only person he truly cares about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warped Reality is a hard-boiled cyberpunk visual novel about trust, ambition, and what you’re willing to become when the network starts answering back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A story-first cyberpunk visual novel with branching choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple endings and routes worth replaying</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Virtual worlds that shift tone myth, neon, nightmare</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Minigames and extras unlocked as you dig deeper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 26 Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Controller-friendly play; Steam Deck ready</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Free demo available on the store page</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16+ Confirmed hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Kazu survive? Can he trust his friends? Can he save the woman he loves?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices decide your fate.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604030/extras/5f7a736326ce0d8fc9d6d7cadb85c952.avif?t=1792452403\" width=456 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if the thing you always dreamed of building becomes your worst nightmare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2065, chrome skyscrapers and holographic ads tower over alleyways of blood and grime. Money rules. Corporations own the future. Everyone else scrapes by.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Kazu, a young technophile trying to prove he belongs as a cybernetics designer. All he wanted was an entertainment system that would finally open doors. What he creates instead is the Virtual Machine: a breakthrough that was never supposed to exist… and that the wrong people will kill to control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunted by criminals and corrupt officials alike, Kazu is pulled into virtual worlds designed to weed out the weak — from a mythological age that never was, to a future where humanity is only a memory. His own life is on the line. So is the life of the only person he truly cares about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warped Reality is a hard-boiled cyberpunk visual novel about trust, ambition, and what you’re willing to become when the network starts answering back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A story-first cyberpunk visual novel with branching choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple endings and routes worth replaying</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Virtual worlds that shift tone myth, neon, nightmare</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Minigames and extras unlocked as you dig deeper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 26 Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Controller-friendly play; Steam Deck ready</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Free demo available on the store page</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16+ Confirmed hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Kazu survive? Can he trust his friends? Can he save the woman he loves?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices decide your fate.</p>",
            "short_description": "A gritty cyberpunk visual novel. Build the VR system of your dreams — then survive the corporations, criminals, and virtual worlds that come hunting for it. Your choices decide who you can still trust.",
